direction: right
Clients: API clients {shape: person}
Gateway: API gateway {shape: hexagon}
Limiter: Rate limiter {shape: rectangle}
Rules: Policy service {shape: rectangle}
Counters: Distributed counters {shape: stored_data}
API: Backend API {shape: rectangle}
Metrics: Metrics stream {shape: queue}
Clients -> Gateway
Gateway -> Limiter: check quota
Limiter -> Rules: load policy
Limiter -> Counters: atomic increment
Limiter -> Gateway: allow or reject
Gateway -> API: allowed request
Limiter -> Metrics: decisions
